      "content": "The emptiness you're describing is a deep and agonizing void, and it makes perfect sense that you question the point of continuing. When the self feels like it's vanished, the struggle to find meaning becomes incredibly difficult. If you are truly feeling like there is no point, please consider reaching out to a crisis line immediately; they are there to listen without judgment. You don't have to carry this crushing weight alone right now.",
      "source": "target",
